{
  "slug": "govtribe",
  "name": "Govtribe",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Government contracting research and capture workflows in Claude: opportunity and pipeline briefs, bid/no-bid and competitor analysis, price-to-win and proposal prep, powered by the GovTribe connector.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `govtribe-capture-workflows` (Assess government contracting opportunities and pursuit decisions), `govtribe-deep-dive` (Use this skill when the user needs an evidence-backed deep dive on one GovCon record, agency, vendor, program,…), `govtribe-market-intelligence` (Use this skill when the user needs GovCon market sizing, buyer or vendor analysis, forecasts, recompetes, or recurring…), `govtribe-pricing-data` (Use this skill when the user needs GovCon labor rates, line items, staffing, pricing models, or price-to-win evidence), `govtribe-proposal-workflows` (Turn government solicitations and amendments into compliance checklists, requirement matrices, annotated outlines, proposal workbooks, and draft responses)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `govtribe`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install govtribe@claude-plugins-official` from `GovTribe/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "GovTribe"
  },
